     2607     :
     2608       find first ub.contract-specif-attr exclusive-lock  where
     2609                 ub.contract-specif-attr.contract-num = p-contract-num  and
     2610                 ub.contract-specif-attr.host-code    = p-host-code     and
     2611                 ub.contract-specif-attr.gds-code     = p-gds-code      and
